WEBVTT

00:00.390 --> 00:01.720
<b>The Imperial army is...</b>

00:01.720 --> 00:03.700
<b>Attacking the royal palace...?</b>

00:03.950 --> 00:07.900
<b>We were caught off guard. I've 
yet to fully grasp the situation.</b>

00:07.900 --> 00:11.660
<b>All I know for sure is that 
the palace is under fire.</b>

00:13.340 --> 00:16.710
<b>Rin! Quickly get the car ready!</b>

00:17.750 --> 00:18.880
<b>Of course!</b>

00:18.880 --> 00:23.210
<b>If they are the Imperial army, 
how did they cross the border?</b>

00:23.580 --> 00:26.670
<b>Mother, I'm heading back 
to the palace immediately.</b>

00:26.670 --> 00:28.760
<b>Please be safe!</b>

00:28.760 --> 00:30.750
<b>I have no other intentions.</b>

00:30.750 --> 00:33.840
<b>And at a time like this...
I'll be there soon, Mother!</b>

00:37.610 --> 00:41.520
<b>Could it be that the reason the Imperial 
army knew of my absence was because...</b>

00:42.900 --> 00:46.420
<b>What's going on? You seem to be in such a hurry.</b>

00:47.220 --> 00:48.280
<b>Was it you?</b>

00:48.690 --> 00:51.090
<b>Did you secretly send in the Imperial army?</b>

00:52.120 --> 00:53.100
<b>Alice?</b>

00:53.460 --> 00:56.120
<b>I'm heading back to the palace right now.</b>

00:56.120 --> 00:57.120
<b>What?</b>

00:57.120 --> 00:58.530
<b>Promise me one thing.</b>

00:58.530 --> 01:01.590
<b>I want to believe you had 
nothing to do with this.</b>

01:01.980 --> 01:04.590
<b>So I want you to stay and wait here.</b>

01:04.590 --> 01:06.580
<b>Not one step outside this palace!</b>

01:08.710 --> 01:11.060
<b>Alice, what's going on?</b>

01:11.520 --> 01:13.200
<b>Don't go outside!</b>

01:13.200 --> 01:16.560
<b>I won't forgive you if you show any inclination 
that you're working with the Imperial Army!</b>

01:16.800 --> 01:19.890
<b>What does that mean? What happened?!</b>

01:20.230 --> 01:21.220
<b>Promise me.</b>

02:55.570 --> 03:00.380
<b>How boring. A coup, plotting 
to assassinate the queen?</b>

02:55.570 --> 03:01.550
<b>Line of Descent:
Beginning of the End of Paradise</b>

03:01.090 --> 03:03.070
<b>Hydra's handiwork, yet again.</b>

03:03.070 --> 03:06.280
<b>I never thought you would help Millavair!</b>

03:07.990 --> 03:11.050
<b>Only I get to call the queen by her name.</b>

03:11.830 --> 03:15.540
<b>Everything's the same as 30 years ago, huh?</b>

03:15.540 --> 03:21.590
<b>Salinger! You... Did you attack the queen?!</b>

03:22.220 --> 03:27.240
<b>I trusted you! I never thought you'd 
be the type to do such a thing!</b>

03:29.080 --> 03:32.600
<b>Milla... No, Queen Millavair...</b>

03:33.070 --> 03:35.570
<b>You're the queen of this nation.</b>

03:35.900 --> 03:41.070
<b>Defend the ideals you hold dear 
to your heart with your life.</b>

03:50.210 --> 03:54.690
<b>Wow, this is pretty solid stuff, Names.</b>

03:55.670 --> 03:58.670
<b>You're 65 seconds late to be in position.</b>

03:58.670 --> 04:03.250
<b>They're heat resistant.
An attack like this won't do much.</b>

04:03.250 --> 04:05.780
<b>Which is why I used incendiary bombs.</b>

04:06.270 --> 04:08.470
<b>Hence the 65 seconds.</b>

04:10.390 --> 04:11.960
<b>I guess.</b>

04:12.370 --> 04:14.520
<b>By the way, where's Johaim?</b>

04:14.520 --> 04:18.690
<b>He's already on his way to the queen's palace.</b>

04:19.560 --> 04:23.750
<b>The queen's palace will be full of monsters.</b>

04:23.750 --> 04:25.520
<b>Don't mess up.</b>

04:25.520 --> 04:28.380
<b>You think I'll have my guard down? Think again!</b>

04:28.380 --> 04:30.180
<b>I'm gonna give it my all in this witch hunt.</b>

04:30.180 --> 04:35.290
<b>Let's see what kind of monsters these 
descendants of the Founder are.</b>

04:38.220 --> 04:42.380
<b>The Imperial army? It can't be...</b>

04:43.010 --> 04:46.420
<b>H-Hold on! I don't believe this!</b>

04:46.420 --> 04:47.190
<b>Me either!</b>

04:47.190 --> 04:51.140
<b>We didn't know anything. W-We swear...</b>

04:51.840 --> 04:56.900
<b>Yes, I have been watching you the whole time.</b>

04:56.900 --> 05:00.570
<b>Please remember what my 
sister Elletear had said.</b>

05:00.570 --> 05:04.490
<b>Don't worry, if you stay put, 
your servant will come back.</b>

05:04.490 --> 05:08.620
<b>In other words, she wants us to look the 
other way when the palace is being invaded.</b>

05:08.620 --> 05:10.680
<b>Elletear!</b>

05:10.680 --> 05:15.370
<b>I... I do not know where your heart lies!</b>

05:15.370 --> 05:18.790
<b>Are you trying to betray your motherland?!</b>

05:18.790 --> 05:19.500
<b>Huh?</b>

05:19.500 --> 05:20.590
<b>Get down.</b>

05:20.590 --> 05:22.780
<b>W-What are you doing?!</b>

05:22.780 --> 05:24.090
<b>Stay away from the window!</b>

05:24.090 --> 05:27.130
<b>I heard an electronic sound with the gunfire.</b>

05:27.130 --> 05:32.930
<b>Assault rifle TH, Type 87, I think.
That's an Imperial gun.</b>

05:33.880 --> 05:37.770
<b>This palace is also under attack. 
It's not just the royal palace.</b>

05:37.770 --> 05:40.240
<b>T-This can't be true!</b>

05:40.600 --> 05:42.900
<b>Stop yapping and be quiet.</b>

05:42.900 --> 05:43.470
<b>Boss.</b>

05:43.470 --> 05:44.610
<b>Yup!</b>

05:44.610 --> 05:45.530
<b>Iska.</b>

05:45.530 --> 05:46.280
<b>Got it!</b>

05:48.990 --> 05:51.660
<b>Wait! We're from the Imperial army, too!</b>

05:51.870 --> 05:54.970
<b>Move, Iska! They aren't Imperial soldiers.</b>

05:56.950 --> 05:59.750
<b>No mercy, not even for your 
fellow soldiers, I see.</b>

05:59.750 --> 06:01.960
<b>I told you, they're not Imperial soldiers.</b>

06:02.880 --> 06:08.030
<b>Assault rifle TH, Type 87 is standard 
issue for Imperial soldiers,</b>

06:08.030 --> 06:11.670
<b>but the center of gravity is actually at 
the muzzle, making it tricky to shoot.</b>

06:12.080 --> 06:16.480
<b>These guys didn't know that. One look 
at the stance and it's clear as day.</b>

06:16.480 --> 06:20.400
<b>Iska! Jhin! Look at this!</b>

06:20.400 --> 06:22.690
<b>He has an astral crest on his cheek!</b>

06:22.880 --> 06:24.800
<b>That confirms it.</b>

06:24.800 --> 06:30.970
<b>These guys aren't Imperial soldiers. 
They're astral mages from your nation.</b>

06:30.970 --> 06:32.320
<b>Recognize any of them?</b>

06:32.720 --> 06:34.490
<b>No, I don't...</b>

06:34.490 --> 06:38.860
<b>So the real Imperial army attacks the 
royal palace, and a fake one attacks here?</b>

06:39.350 --> 06:40.820
<b>What's going on?</b>

06:40.820 --> 06:45.210
<b>Everyone, gunshots from downstairs! 
They're already inside this palace!</b>

06:45.410 --> 06:47.710
<b>Sisbell, where are the maids?!</b>

06:48.290 --> 06:51.670
<b>Their rooms are in the back,
so they should be safe for a while!</b>

06:51.670 --> 06:55.200
<b>Then let's push through to the 
front door while we still can!</b>

06:55.420 --> 06:56.560
<b>Right!</b>

06:56.560 --> 07:00.170
<b>If they open fire from a distance, 
I'll take care of them.</b>

07:00.170 --> 07:02.560
<b>Iska will handle all mid-ranged astral arts.</b>

07:02.560 --> 07:03.810
<b>Roger that!</b>

07:03.810 --> 07:06.400
<b>Whoever it may be, I'll cut them down!</b>

07:25.340 --> 07:29.690
<b>Hello, Lady Sisbell.
I'm glad you made it out safely.</b>

07:29.690 --> 07:32.720
<b>I'm Hydra's family head, Talisman.</b>

07:32.720 --> 07:35.640
<b>Lord Talisman?! Why are you here?</b>

07:35.640 --> 07:37.700
<b>You're safe now.</b>

07:37.700 --> 07:42.770
<b>The royal palace is in great danger,
but I will keep you safe.</b>

07:43.050 --> 07:45.400
<b>You're talking about the 
attack by the Imperial army.</b>

07:45.400 --> 07:50.400
<b>Yes. The Empire's goal is to take 
down the queen and her entourage.</b>

07:50.400 --> 07:53.990
<b>In fact, the queen said 
you're also in danger.</b>

07:54.260 --> 07:55.620
<b>The queen said that?</b>

07:55.620 --> 08:00.830
<b>We must hurry. Please get in my car 
before more Imperial soldiers arrive.</b>

08:07.420 --> 08:09.680
<b>I have two questions for you.</b>

08:09.680 --> 08:11.920
<b>If you really are Hydra's family head,</b>

08:11.920 --> 08:15.410
<b>how do you explain Vichyssoise's attack on us?</b>

08:15.980 --> 08:20.010
<b>Already explained in the 
inquisition with the queen.</b>

08:20.010 --> 08:23.610
<b>I have no way of knowing 
why she did what she did.</b>

08:23.610 --> 08:27.860
<b>I also find the witness's accounts of 
her transformation hard to believe.</b>

08:27.860 --> 08:30.730
<b>Fine. One more question, then.</b>

08:31.030 --> 08:37.280
<b>We do need to hurry, but I shall answer 
any questions to prove my innocence.</b>

08:37.280 --> 08:41.510
<b>Idiot. Two people are behind the coup.</b>

08:41.510 --> 08:43.850
<b>That'd be you and Elletear.</b>

08:44.600 --> 08:47.380
<b>What?! H-Hold on, what are you saying, Jhin?!</b>

08:47.590 --> 08:51.090
<b>The real Imperial army is attacking 
the royal palace right now.</b>

08:51.090 --> 08:54.640
<b>If that's the case, why would 
this palace be under attack</b>

08:54.640 --> 08:56.780
<b>by a fake Imperial army
of disguised astral mages?</b>

08:57.780 --> 09:02.560
<b>Coup's a coup, but with Vichyssoise, 
it was done extremely openly.</b>

09:03.270 --> 09:07.350
<b>So why bother disguising themselves 
as the Imperial soldiers this time?</b>

09:07.960 --> 09:11.290
<b>Answer's simple. Under the 
current circumstances,</b>

09:11.290 --> 09:14.990
<b>everyone would assume the 
Imperial army kidnapped Sisbell.</b>

09:14.990 --> 09:18.660
<b>If that's not enough, the only one 
who'd target Sisbell relentlessly</b>

09:18.660 --> 09:21.640
<b>has to be the mastermind behind 
the queen's assassination.</b>

09:22.120 --> 09:26.290
<b>After all, if she returns to the royal palace,
she can find out who did it.</b>

09:26.290 --> 09:33.090
<b>Hold on. Our family is not the most 
opposed to the current regime.</b>

09:33.090 --> 09:35.830
<b>So you wanna say it's the Zoas?
I don't think so.</b>

09:35.830 --> 09:38.720
<b>The Masked Lord had nothing 
to do with this mess.</b>

09:38.720 --> 09:40.530
<b>How can you be so sure?</b>

09:40.880 --> 09:44.780
<b>Because we fought him in Alsamira.</b>

09:44.780 --> 09:49.370
<b>Apparently, Zoa's a radical faction 
just itching to destroy the Empire.</b>

09:49.790 --> 09:53.640
<b>If so, there's no way he'd work 
with the Empire to stage a coup.</b>

09:53.640 --> 09:56.080
<b>This is all just your imagination.</b>

09:56.080 --> 09:59.380
<b>What if that was all just an act?</b>

10:00.450 --> 10:05.140
<b>If he's working with the Empire, 
he could've bribed us in Alsamira,</b>

10:05.140 --> 10:08.250
<b>and just taken care 
of Sisbell then and there.</b>

10:09.670 --> 10:12.390
<b>Zoa's innocent as far as this coup goes.</b>

10:12.390 --> 10:16.090
<b>That just leaves us with one descendant.</b>

10:16.300 --> 10:18.840
<b>The Hydra family is the one behind the coup.</b>

10:20.550 --> 10:22.630
<b>Such beautiful logic.</b>

10:22.630 --> 10:26.840
<b>I see, so you've met the Masked Lord.</b>

10:26.840 --> 10:30.080
<b>Well, no matter. I shall 
simply keep carrying on.</b>

10:30.080 --> 10:34.110
<b>The only thing that'll remain will be the 
Empire's gunpowder and bullet holes.</b>

10:34.110 --> 10:37.530
<b>Lord Talisman?! So you 
really are the mastermind?!</b>

10:37.530 --> 10:40.410
<b>All of this is necessary.</b>

10:40.410 --> 10:45.090
<b>We need the Empire's help to 
reach the core of this planet.</b>

10:45.240 --> 10:47.510
<b>Let's work together, Lady Sisbell.</b>

10:47.940 --> 10:53.060
<b>Your astral spirit has the power to 
unlock the mysteries of this planet.</b>

10:54.240 --> 10:56.300
<b>What are you talking about?!</b>

10:56.300 --> 10:59.380
<b>However, your bodyguards will not be so lucky.</b>

10:59.380 --> 11:03.750
<b>Having too many players in this 
game would be a turnoff, after all.</b>

11:03.750 --> 11:06.140
<b>I must ask for them to leave.</b>

11:08.940 --> 11:13.020
<b>What's the big surprise?
These are the bombs you prepared.</b>

11:14.770 --> 11:17.070
<b>We're used to handling Imperial weapons.</b>

11:17.320 --> 11:18.950
<b>Sisbell, run!</b>

11:20.400 --> 11:21.720
<b>Please be careful!</b>

11:21.720 --> 11:24.410
<b>Lord Talisman's astral art uses waves!</b>

11:27.200 --> 11:30.690
<b>Impressive. You dodged that.</b>

11:32.290 --> 11:36.340
<b>You won't be able to blame 
the Empire after all this.</b>

11:36.340 --> 11:41.590
<b>No worries, I'll just burn everything 
down using Imperial explosives.</b>

11:41.590 --> 11:44.840
<b>Astral energy will dissipate soon enough,</b>

11:44.840 --> 11:47.930
<b>leaving nothing but the damage 
caused by the Imperial army.</b>

11:48.670 --> 11:50.860
<b>Secure Lady Sisbell.</b>

11:50.860 --> 11:51.740
<b>Yes, sir!</b>

11:52.190 --> 11:58.030
<b>My, my. It isn't in my nature to 
engage in such a barbaric act...</b>

11:58.530 --> 12:00.240
<b>I don't buy that.</b>

12:00.240 --> 12:04.740
<b>It's true. I dislike violence.</b>

12:05.300 --> 12:10.370
<b>However, "purification" is a different story.</b>

12:11.010 --> 12:15.490
<b>This is to purify this planet's spirit.</b>

12:17.880 --> 12:18.810
<b>Hurry!</b>

12:18.810 --> 12:19.830
<b>Put the fire out!</b>

12:19.830 --> 12:21.140
<b>We're under attack!</b>

12:24.210 --> 12:26.750
<b>So this is the astral spirit's fortress?</b>

12:26.750 --> 12:30.310
<b>So many mechanisms made with 
unknown materials and logic.</b>

12:30.640 --> 12:34.400
<b>Looks like it's gonna be a pain 
to get to the queen's palace.</b>

12:34.900 --> 12:39.760
<b>Miss Mei, the front door to 
the queen's palace is closed.</b>

12:39.760 --> 12:41.110
<b>Our guns aren't working.</b>

12:41.110 --> 12:43.350
<b>I know, Cappy.</b>

12:43.350 --> 12:45.780
<b>That's why we're taking a detour.</b>

12:47.800 --> 12:48.930
<b>Hm?</b>

12:48.930 --> 12:51.870
<b>So that's how this is gonna go.</b>

12:52.850 --> 12:57.910
<b>Disappearing objects? Must be space-time 
based if space itself disappeared.</b>

12:57.910 --> 12:59.930
<b>Either way, it's vicious.</b>

13:00.340 --> 13:02.290
<b>Nice to meet you, little miss.</b>

13:02.640 --> 13:06.730
<b>We've been expecting you, 
soldiers of the Empire.</b>

13:07.390 --> 13:12.310
<b>My name is Kissing Zoa Nebulis IX.</b>

13:12.310 --> 13:13.840
<b>A-A purebred?!</b>

13:13.840 --> 13:15.690
<b>They've finally appeared.</b>

13:16.190 --> 13:19.110
<b>Well, it took you long enough.</b>

13:19.110 --> 13:20.270
<b>I was asleep.</b>

13:22.790 --> 13:27.990
<b>Of course you were! Any child would 
be asleep this late at night.</b>

13:28.300 --> 13:30.210
<b>That's why you need to disappear.</b>

13:30.210 --> 13:33.910
<b>I haven't gotten enough sleep, 
so I must eliminate you.</b>

13:35.520 --> 13:42.230
<b>Look. The flames swelling above like 
a grand flower blooming in the night.</b>

13:42.810 --> 13:46.220
<b>A beautiful, yet cruel and fragile flower.</b>

13:46.770 --> 13:49.910
<b>Pity. I'm terribly disappointed.</b>

13:50.510 --> 13:56.560
<b>Ah, because the Imperial soldiers 
who showed up are nobodies like us?</b>

13:56.940 --> 14:02.770
<b>I had planned for this crimson flower
to bloom in the Empire,</b>

14:02.770 --> 14:07.810
<b>but you beat us to it.
That's what is disappointing.</b>

14:07.810 --> 14:12.150
<b>Aw, I guess we both think alike.</b>

14:12.150 --> 14:14.130
<b>So, how do you want to do this?</b>

14:14.130 --> 14:17.580
<b>It'd be easier to talk if 
we knew each other's names.</b>

14:17.580 --> 14:21.710
<b>Ah, apologies. My name is On.</b>

14:22.010 --> 14:24.920
<b>People call me the Masked Lord.</b>

14:24.920 --> 14:29.300
<b>What a gentleman. I'm Risya.</b>

14:29.820 --> 14:30.960
<b>Yes, the Saint Disciple.</b>

14:31.340 --> 14:33.880
<b>Oh, you already know.</b>

14:34.400 --> 14:39.900
<b>I have a message for you from our family head.</b>

14:39.900 --> 14:41.270
<b>Yeah?</b>

14:41.680 --> 14:43.420
<b>First, let me express my gratitude.</b>

14:41.680 --> 14:43.420
<b>First, let me express my gratitude.</b>

14:43.870 --> 14:48.350
<b>The fate of this planet 
brought us a wonderful guest.</b>

14:43.870 --> 14:48.350
<b>The fate of this planet 
brought us a wonderful guest.</b>

14:49.600 --> 14:52.200
<b>Forty years ago, my legs went bad.</b>

14:52.790 --> 14:56.830
<b>When I realized my dream of fighting in 
the battlefield would never come true,</b>

14:57.110 --> 15:02.370
<b>I was crushed by the greatest grief of my life.</b>

15:07.350 --> 15:11.910
<b>So, thank you, for visiting our land, assassin.</b>

15:11.910 --> 15:16.440
<b>Thank you for giving me the chance 
to destroy the Empire once again!</b>

15:22.200 --> 15:24.190
<b>Die, demon.</b>

15:25.630 --> 15:29.280
<b>Your sin runs deep.</b>

15:29.280 --> 15:30.700
<b>What?</b>

15:30.700 --> 15:38.040
<b>I'm Zoa's family head, Growley.
Allow me to measure the depth of your sin.</b>

15:40.300 --> 15:43.710
<b>There's an escape stairway! 
We can leave from here!</b>

15:44.510 --> 15:46.980
<b>A secret passage in case of emergency, huh?</b>

15:46.980 --> 15:49.710
<b>Yes. I'll lead the way.</b>

15:56.110 --> 15:59.650
<b>Look, this is amazing, Nene. 
It's a literal loophole.</b>

15:59.650 --> 16:02.010
<b>You don't see this kind of thing in the Empire.</b>

16:02.010 --> 16:04.440
<b>Stop being impressed and go in.</b>

16:06.170 --> 16:10.660
<b>Quit holding on so tight. It'll be 
hard for me to move when I need to.</b>

16:11.370 --> 16:15.910
<b>W-What are you talking 
about?! I-I am not scared!</b>

16:16.320 --> 16:19.290
<b>Boss, Nene, how much ammo do you have left?</b>

16:19.290 --> 16:23.480
<b>Um, the battery for my taser is about half-full.</b>

16:23.480 --> 16:27.670
<b>I have 12. I also picked up a grenade 
from those soldiers we just took down.</b>

16:27.670 --> 16:29.870
<b>So a war of attrition isn't an option.</b>

16:30.550 --> 16:31.430
<b>What?!</b>

16:31.430 --> 16:32.260
<b>Fall back!</b>

16:34.170 --> 16:36.840
<b>They even know about this secret passage!</b>

16:36.840 --> 16:37.830
<b>But how?!</b>

16:37.830 --> 16:39.260
<b>Just keep running!</b>

16:39.870 --> 16:41.340
<b>An astral art of ice?</b>

16:41.770 --> 16:44.730
<b>Looks like they mean business.</b>

16:49.090 --> 16:51.220
<b>This should buy us some time...</b>

16:52.150 --> 16:55.970
<b>Winter Scenery: the Great Snowy Ravine.</b>

16:57.660 --> 17:01.160
<b>Do you know the difference between snow and ice?</b>

17:01.160 --> 17:05.420
<b>If you don't, allow me to 
show you the world of snow.</b>

17:07.830 --> 17:13.260
<b>Nice to meet you, Lady Sisbell. 
I believe we've never met before.</b>

17:13.260 --> 17:15.700
<b>W-Who are you?!</b>

17:15.700 --> 17:18.050
<b>The Midnight Sun Witch, Grugell.</b>

17:19.100 --> 17:22.290
<b>An Imperial soldier that knows me?</b>

17:22.290 --> 17:27.020
<b>I heard the whole troop from the Fifth 
Division were utterly crushed by you.</b>

17:27.020 --> 17:28.550
<b>Indeed.</b>

17:32.440 --> 17:35.900
<b>I rule the world of snow.</b>

17:35.900 --> 17:40.490
<b>In here, not even the descendants 
of the Founder can stop me.</b>

17:41.240 --> 17:44.040
<b>Faster, Rin. Punch it to 300 mph.</b>

17:44.400 --> 17:46.370
<b>That's absurd.</b>

17:46.720 --> 17:51.640
<b>If the Imperial army is really invading, 
how much damage could they do?</b>

17:52.790 --> 17:57.190
<b>Not much. At most, only a few dozen 
of them could have infiltrated us.</b>

17:57.840 --> 17:59.650
<b>The only things that could've passed security</b>

17:59.650 --> 18:02.510
<b>would've been handguns and 
disassembled assault rifles.</b>

18:03.250 --> 18:04.480
<b>You're right.</b>

18:04.480 --> 18:07.940
<b>However, even if the Sovereignty's 
damage may be small,</b>

18:07.940 --> 18:09.770
<b>the same cannot be said for the royal family.</b>

18:10.200 --> 18:13.110
<b>Even if none of our people get hurt,</b>

18:13.420 --> 18:15.940
<b>if the queen falls, this nation will also fall.</b>

18:18.740 --> 18:20.050
<b>How could this be?!</b>

18:20.050 --> 18:25.750
<b>How many weapons was the Imperial 
army able to bring in?!</b>

18:26.330 --> 18:27.480
<b>I can't believe it...</b>

18:29.120 --> 18:32.900
<b>Seems the Imperial army has 
crossed the Sovereignty's border.</b>

18:32.900 --> 18:36.970
<b>Everything is moving along.
Now we just wait for the invasion.</b>

18:36.970 --> 18:42.060
<b>It must be at the hands of the 
Imperial army that we lose our queen.</b>

18:42.440 --> 18:43.450
<b>Yes.</b>

18:43.450 --> 18:47.930
<b>But your little sister, 
Alice, will be in our way.</b>

18:48.330 --> 18:51.540
<b>As far as strength goes,
she's the most powerful of the Lou.</b>

18:52.550 --> 18:55.370
<b>If Alice focuses on protecting the queen,</b>

18:55.370 --> 18:58.360
<b>the Imperial army won't stand a chance.</b>

18:58.740 --> 19:03.930
<b>Then we must find a way to pull 
Lady Alice away from the queen.</b>

19:03.930 --> 19:07.450
<b>I'm thinking of going on a little getaway.</b>

19:07.450 --> 19:09.750
<b>To Lou's vacation house.</b>

19:09.750 --> 19:11.710
<b>For what purpose?</b>

19:12.010 --> 19:17.500
<b>If Sisbell returns to the palace,
she'll know who exploded the queen's Hall.</b>

19:17.500 --> 19:19.710
<b>The house of Hydra will be exiled.</b>

19:19.710 --> 19:24.510
<b>I'll intercept Sisbell and take 
her to Lou's vacation house.</b>

19:24.510 --> 19:27.170
<b>Basically, a way to prevent her 
from returning to the palace.</b>

19:27.170 --> 19:32.690
<b>I see, and your self-indulgent action 
will force Lady Alice to come get you,</b>

19:32.690 --> 19:36.820
<b>following you to the vacation house, 
pulling her away from the queen.</b>

19:36.820 --> 19:42.490
<b>Exactly right! This way, only 
Lou VIII will be at the palace.</b>

19:42.490 --> 19:46.170
<b>Lure Lady Alice and Lady Sisbell
to the vacation house,</b>

19:46.170 --> 19:49.370
<b>so the Imperial army can seize 
this chance to attack the queen.</b>

19:49.370 --> 19:52.040
<b>Very good. Two birds with one stone.</b>

19:52.040 --> 19:56.960
<b>Oh, come now! It's four birds with one stone.</b>

19:57.770 --> 20:02.930
<b>One move. That's all it'll take 
to bring down the current regime.</b>

20:02.930 --> 20:05.970
<b>That'll kick off the election 
for the next queen.</b>

20:06.400 --> 20:10.100
<b>I suppose you'll be running for Lou, Elletear?</b>

20:10.100 --> 20:13.170
<b>I've grown tired of this nation.</b>

20:13.570 --> 20:17.010
<b>I don't care what happens 
as long as it's destroyed.</b>

20:17.010 --> 20:18.690
<b>I shall leave the future to you.</b>

20:18.980 --> 20:24.570
<b>It'll be my pleasure. Allow me to take 
you to the Tower of Stars, at least.</b>

20:25.140 --> 20:27.160
<b>Captain Ornake.</b>

20:27.160 --> 20:30.580
<b>It's a pleasure to meet you, Princess Elletear.</b>

20:30.580 --> 20:31.900
<b>Who is this?</b>

20:31.900 --> 20:35.660
<b>The captain of the intelligence corps 
that the house of Hydra had hired.</b>

20:35.660 --> 20:37.620
<b>A top-notch assassin.</b>

20:38.040 --> 20:39.950
<b>My, how dependable!</b>

20:39.950 --> 20:42.990
<b>Escort her with the utmost care.</b>

20:43.330 --> 20:43.840
<b>Of course.</b>

20:44.170 --> 20:48.510
<b>Well, then, I'll be on my way 
to my vacation, as planned.</b>

20:48.510 --> 20:53.390
<b>All right. Now we just wait for them.</b>

20:57.060 --> 21:00.490
<b>Alice, Sisbell, Mother...</b>

21:01.360 --> 21:06.780
<b>You've all been blessed with great astral spirits,
recognized just for that.</b>

21:07.590 --> 21:12.170
<b>You'll never understand the feelings 
of someone who was born weak.</b>

21:13.330 --> 21:19.400
<b>You probably think that this nation 
will never fall as long as you're here.</b>

21:20.420 --> 21:23.340
<b>But you're largely mistaken.</b>

21:24.400 --> 21:28.230
<b>Your misfortune is that your 
astral spirits were too powerful.</b>

21:28.650 --> 21:30.770
<b>Nothing can be changed with that.</b>

21:31.140 --> 21:35.700
<b>Astral mages' paradise is 
nothing more than an illusion.</b>

21:36.510 --> 21:39.420
<b>Tonight, this palace will go down in flames.</b>

21:39.920 --> 21:44.480
<b>And I will be the witch of catastrophe 
that ignites those flames.</b>

21:45.450 --> 21:49.700
<b>That is what is necessary 
to aim for a true paradise.</b>

21:50.210 --> 21:52.830
<b>Keep the fire extinguishing to a minimum.</b>

21:52.830 --> 21:55.160
<b>Use the extra manpower to guard the tower.</b>

21:56.310 --> 21:57.650
<b>I'm counting on you.</b>

21:57.650 --> 21:58.580
<b>Yes, my queen!</b>

22:02.250 --> 22:06.220
<b>This is just a ripple.
My kingdom will not be shaken.</b>

22:06.600 --> 22:09.640
<b>This is a paradise for all astral mages.</b>

22:10.040 --> 22:11.970
<b>No one shall trample...</b>

22:11.970 --> 22:16.100
<b>"For all" astral mages? Is that really true?</b>

22:19.610 --> 22:22.150
<b>Queen Nebulis, I presume.</b>

22:25.620 --> 22:29.610
<b>I'm Johaim, the first seat 
of the Saint Disciples.</b>

22:30.000 --> 22:31.370
<b>You are?</b>

22:33.180 --> 22:34.910
<b>Do you wish to seek forgiveness?</b>

22:35.250 --> 22:40.020
<b>Silence, low-life. Who do you think I am?</b>

22:40.420 --> 22:47.080
<b>I am Queen Nebulis. As the leader 
of this nation, I will vanquish you.</b>

22:47.080 --> 22:49.930
<b>You speak of a dream, queen.</b>

22:50.610 --> 22:52.970
<b>This nation is no paradise.</b>

22:53.390 --> 23:00.020
<b>The dream of deception ends here, 
and a new world shall be reborn.</b>
